/S /P
/P 1441 0 R
/E (Total Cost Efficiency Evaluation: The store branches operating in the US need to conduct a comprehensive review of their production, operational, and promotional strategies. This aims to identify cost components that can be minimised, ensuring that the high sales volume is accompanied by a higher profit margin, at least comparable to the percentage achieved by store branches in the UK and Canada, which is more than 20%.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [11]
>>
