/P 1484 0 R
/E (The last quarter of the year was the busiest period across all six countries. While most countries reached their highest sales volumes in November and December, the US and the UK even entered their peak sales periods one month earlier, beginning in October.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
426 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1485 0 R
/E (Several countries also experienced additional peak sales periods outside the last quarter. For instance, France reached higher sales volumes in March, May, and September, while Canada showed increased sales activity in August. In addition, Australia also experienced relatively high sales volumes in March and May, similar to France.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
427 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1486 0 R
/E (Most customers preferred using standard delivery and pickup method to receive their ordered products. The use of these two shipping options accounted for 43% and 38.6% of overall orders, respectively.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
428 0 obj
<<
