/S /P
/P 1488 0 R
/E (Seasonal Demand Management: The company should expand its marketing activities and increase inventory levels across all six countries in response to high demand in the last quarter of the year. Similar efforts should also be implemented during additional peak months in each country. These strategies will allow the company to boost the conversion rate, while ensuring that product availability can accommodate the surge in customer needs.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
431 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1489 0 R
/E (Shipping Process Monitoring: The delivery service plays a crucial role in determining customer satisfaction. Therefore, it is important to monitor its processes by tracking on-time delivery performance and evaluating service consistency across different methods. The company also needs to gather information about potential issues that lead to product returns, as this is essential for identifying areas in delivery system that require improvement.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
